Node ID=48 the burning joining
Text=I know. It looked out of you as you entered, and it knows what I am becoming, and does not care for it. So hear this and do as you like with it: a thing from below can be joined with, exactly as a man can be joined with a spirit of time. Whether what results is you or it is not decided by either of you. It is decided by which of you is the more patient.
